# Commits and public docs

- README, GitHub description, and other public docs stay **English**. In-app UI stays Chinese.
- After any `git commit` / `amend` this agent makes, read `git log -1 --format=%B`. If it contains `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, do **not** `git commit --amend` (Cursor restamps it). Rebuild with `git commit-tree` on the same tree and parent, `git reset --soft` to that SHA, re-read the message.
- **Never push** a commit whose message has that trailer. If one is already on the remote, replace it with `git push --force-with-lease`. Message-only rewrite; do not change the tree.
- Do not write `Co-authored-by`, `Generated by`, or `Cursor Agent` into commit messages yourself.
